package components

// BookMark is the open-book brand mark: two pages, a lighter left and a denser
// right, drawn with the same ░/▓ shade characters the bookshelf easter egg
// uses. It is monospace so the two cells line up at every size. Decorative —
// the link around it carries the accessible name.
templ BookMark() {
	<span class="book-mark" aria-hidden="true">
		<span class="book-page book-page-a">░</span>
		<span class="book-page book-page-b">▓</span>
	</span>
}
